    <string name="focus_help_timer_body">Choose a timer preset, start a session, and pause or reset when needed. A running timer survives module navigation and process recreation. Completed sessions appear in Focus history and daily totals.</string>
    <string name="focus_help_alarms_body">Create an alarm and allow Synapse notifications when Android asks. Alarms are scheduled for their next time and turn off after delivery, matching the React alarm flow. Android may delay delivery while the device is idle.</string>
    <string name="focus_help_lofi_body">Import an audio file from this device to add it to Focus. Playback streams from the original document provider. Deleting a track moves its record to Trash; permanent deletion releases the URI grant when no other Core entry uses it.</string>
    <string name="focus_help_data_body">Focus sessions, alarm records, and track metadata are stored locally through Core. Native Lofi playback and Focus records are not synced or encrypted on Android yet.</string>
